Package: zabbix-widget-event-timeline
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, php (>= 2:8.1~)
Description: Event Timeline widget for Zabbix dashboard
 Zabbix dashboard widget that visualizes problem events as severity-stacked
 charts over time or grouped by host, host group, or event. It supports
 dashboard-linked sources, runtime filters, paging, tooltips, and drilldown.
